    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>pincers, forceps (OED s.v. pinson^1); a tool for tightly grasping or nipping anything, consisting of two limbs pivoted together, forming a pair of jaws with a pair of handles or levers by which they can be pressed tightly together (OED s.v. pincers n.pl.)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
